<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-118-B habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.461983" lon="-121.033043"><name>SC26-118-B</name><desc>Point Estero rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 9.8 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 67/100; not catch probability. Center 135 ft; nearby 131–163 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9ZSTUK1"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-095</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.467291249470776" lon="-121.03517271464862"/><trkpt lat="35.466480220967085" lon="-121.03519244829165"/><trkpt lat="35.46637934244555" lon="-121.03453373451431"/><trkpt lat="35.46592877117401" lon="-121.03454470094182"/><trkpt lat="35.465934153654985" lon="-121.03487515223495"/><trkpt lat="35.46521323940183" lon="-121.03489269506738"/><trkpt lat="35.46431030250039" lon="-121.03480447450012"/><trkpt lat="35.46421480575947" lon="-121.03447622306682"/><trkpt lat="35.46358400576429" lon="-121.03449157522074"/><trkpt lat="35.46341992132045" lon="-121.03548728459275"/><trkpt lat="35.462969349569626" lon="-121.03549824450572"/><trkpt lat="35.46300161290963" lon="-121.03748088208572"/><trkpt lat="35.46237618558504" lon="-121.03782664742046"/><trkpt lat="35.46237976770642" lon="-121.03804693901981"/><trkpt lat="35.46192561312368" lon="-121.03783759386597"/><trkpt lat="35.46199960331479" lon="-121.03684409729775"/><trkpt lat="35.46127868773888" lon="-121.0368616200173"/><trkpt lat="35.460004539